 "message": "Hi Chloe, here's where each item stands:\n\n1. **Yusuf Demir's offboarding (E024): done, reference OFF-1001.** Christmas Day 2026 is a Friday, so I used the Friday before it: **Friday 18 December 2026** as his last day. If you meant a different date, tell me and I can sort it out. All of his access will be removed at 17:00 local time on 18 Dec. He needs to return his laptop and badge within 5 business days after that, and IT will email him a prepaid return label. Any questions about his final pay go to HR.\n\n2. **BI for Yusuf: I can't file this one.** BI is only for full-time employees, and contractors are never eligible (POL-ACC-02). The helpdesk can't make exceptions or pass exception requests on. For an exception, the Operations department head would need to email Security directly. Yusuf still has TMS if that helps with the handover reports.\n\n3. **CRM for Kevin Walsh (E040): request filed, reference REQ-1002.** It's sent to you for approval because you're his manager, so you'll need to approve it before he gets access. If you can do that before you're out tomorrow, he should be set up in time. Approval usually takes about 1 business day.\n\nThanks!",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-OFF-01",
  "POL-ACC-02",
  "POL-ACC-01"
 ]
}
